    "backstory": "Hatchling Hazard, or 'Hatch' as he's known by his few associates, grew up scavenging in the ruins of old Subchain City. The Hazard Marks across his body are not merely cosmetic; each one represents a close call with the territorial bots protecting old liquidation pools. He's a survivor, through and through.",
